{"summary":"Roguelike Deck-Building On The Go!","description":"Lost For Swords is an addicting fantasy card game with roguelike elements.\n\nEmbark on a journey into dangerous dungeons, slay enemies and collect loot. Upgrade and improve your deck between fights, find synergies between cards and build the most powerful deck as you progress through the adventure!\n\nLost For Swords features unique and always-changing, procedurally generated dungeons and encounters. Your own deck shapes the playing field. No playthroughs are the same.\n\nCollect gold, visit shops to improve your deck and character, add the best cards to your deck and choose the optimal strategy.\n\nLost For Swords is a turn-based roguelike card game with a unique twist: every piece of equipment you pick up, you can only use it once! So plan carefully how you spend your resources. Is your deck strong enough? Will you make it to the next room?\n\nLost For Swords is:\n\n✔️Card Game\n\n✔️Roguelike Dungeon Crawler\n \n✔️Turn Based Strategy\n\nDownload Now!","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":"$5.49 per item","video":null,"header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bnUYyUnkAzK-G3E2KUavu3NevnRpQ-eBNnz-lUAd8f9g68DORHSsZXipE8FretM4LeWAR1e8KuNhSiD5DIWPHw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rsc2ocQ_zuozpKxfPo6cfmtM6ECKP55c2NJa5x0zPYrTVueFp2C87MH1AJrIP3dX3g95u8E9btdnVxMrNGZ6","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bJN8irwgIcrCGLcGcQeh_QM6c9Vr_g_K2myDBYatcm4WjRcfEC4HvFhLyb1s2fPwi2iAMlphX_rnV9F43QUFqA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aum1iQ5MJrQSZ4g4pDv5psWvFFxPTyVaw0Jkj5s7Wc4WjN5O3MJ_ljvLuV-XUA9d9xlAQYhPwsNJllX8dwWg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/263YFOE0LzbWUFzvBUr17SWIYysG4RqZM-XWTZsHv0P5BnDHLomZB0l_ZIbIh28OLpwf-ghSkeSumPfGrTrZUA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DHjEpNC58jpCvUAoEjqF1ND2U2ZN452prT5-EcvKZ3CQskzSxpfB2aWdmxxonOY2b2YwbNZI3OP_7s9hrcYIseA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Lb0oFW-pdgF_aXdSPn_rSN7lTwn17wtDVwk4O6fBuZeLf